give @s minecraft:written_book[minecraft:written_book_content={title:"COBBLEVERSE Guide",author:"Server",pages:['{"text": "COBBLEVERSE\\n\\nThis book lists what the server adds. Get a new copy any time with /guide.\\n\\n/world shows your quest, rank, next gym and today\'s events in one place."}','{"text": "TRAVEL\\n\\n/home: back to the station.\\n\\n/fly: a Pidgeot flies you to gyms you have beaten and to landmarks, for CobbleDollars.\\n\\nLandmarks: the first to find one names it."}','{"text": "EVERY DAY\\n\\nItemfinder: right-click it; five items are hidden around you.\\n\\nHidden Grotto: three Pokémon with hidden abilities.\\n\\nFishing Hole: rare water Pokémon.\\n\\nMass outbreaks every hour or two."}','{"text": "BATTLES\\n\\nGyms: /world points to the next one.\\n\\n/tower: Battle Tower, one trainer a floor.\\n\\n/challenge: a rule for your gym run.\\n\\nRaids, Team Rocket and story bosses come to the village."}','{"text": "LEGENDS\\n\\n/legend: find three relics for a legendary (igloos, ruined portals, shipwrecks, trail ruins, ancient cities), then stand on the quartz of the Legend Shrine by the station."}','{"text": "YOUR POKéMON\\n\\nWalk with a Pokémon sent out: friendship up every 1 km.\\n\\nPokémon ask for things now and then; do it for friendship.\\n\\n/goal <pokemon>: where it spawns.\\n\\n/trade <slot>: Wonder Trade."}','{"text": "THE VILLAGE\\n\\nPut Poké Balls in the village chest at the station to level the village: a Poké Mart, a Daycare, a Battle Court.\\n\\nNight Merchant: at night by the shrine.\\n\\nTeam Expedition: a weekly goal for everyone."}']}] 1
